1
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:12,445
Hi

2
00:00:12,445 --> 00:00:14,014
Oh, yeah…

3
00:00:14,547 --> 00:00:16,649
From the app, right?

4
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:17,884
Yeah, that's me

5
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:20,420
You look even better in person

6
00:00:21,821 --> 00:00:23,823
Thank you

7
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:29,062
After that day, I started meeting new people

8
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:31,664
Trying to forget my ex

9
00:00:32,132 --> 00:00:34,567
Have you eaten yet?

10
00:00:35,101 --> 00:00:36,603
Yeah

11
00:00:36,603 --> 00:00:38,605
What did you have?

12
00:00:39,105 --> 00:00:41,641
What I have at home... nothing special

13
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,945
What do you usually do on weekends?

14
00:00:46,413 --> 00:00:48,782
Not much, really

15
00:00:50,984 --> 00:00:53,453
Do you like movies?

16
00:00:54,287 --> 00:00:56,423
Not really…

17
00:01:05,398 --> 00:01:09,069
These days, using AI is basically a must

18
00:01:09,069 --> 00:01:11,037
Depending on the input you give

19
00:01:11,037 --> 00:01:12,639
Whether it's GPT or Gemini

20
00:01:12,639 --> 00:01:14,507
The range of services you get

21
00:01:14,507 --> 00:01:16,443
Can go from one to a hundred

22
00:01:16,443 --> 00:01:18,812
If you don't know how to use it

23
00:01:18,812 --> 00:01:20,914
You're just falling behind

24
00:01:21,414 --> 00:01:23,316
There aren't even proper laws yet

25
00:01:23,316 --> 00:01:25,318
For AI-made content

26
00:01:25,318 --> 00:01:27,220
Right now, when people hear it's made by AI

27
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:30,090
They start with a negative impression

28
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:31,958
But honestly, within five years

29
00:01:31,958 --> 00:01:34,694
Whether it's movies, new products, or medicine

30
00:01:34,694 --> 00:01:37,797
Stuff made by AI is definitely going to blow up

31
00:01:39,399 --> 00:01:44,037
No one I met could replace my ex

32
00:01:57,584 --> 00:02:00,320
You seem like a really caring person

33
00:02:01,221 --> 00:02:03,256
Me? Why is that?

34
00:02:03,256 --> 00:02:05,058
I don't know, just…

35
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:07,060
You can tell just by how you smile

36
00:02:08,528 --> 00:02:10,830
I like people who are caring

37
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:12,832
That's why I like you, Jihoon

38
00:02:15,235 --> 00:02:17,737
I... is there something on my face?

39
00:02:19,305 --> 00:02:21,774
You're really good with words..

40
00:02:22,775 --> 00:02:23,543
Of course

41
00:02:23,543 --> 00:02:25,211
When I like someone

42
00:02:25,211 --> 00:02:27,881
I don't hold back saying it

43
00:02:32,185 --> 00:02:33,019
Babe..

44
00:02:33,019 --> 00:02:34,988
I really like you

45
00:02:35,221 --> 00:02:36,589
I know

46
00:02:37,323 --> 00:02:39,392
So could you show it to me too

47
00:02:39,392 --> 00:02:41,928
A little more?

48
00:02:42,061 --> 00:02:43,963
Even earlier at the restaurant…

49
00:02:43,963 --> 00:02:45,999
There were a lot of people around

50
00:02:46,966 --> 00:02:48,001
But even when it's just us

51
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:50,069
You don't really say things like that

52
00:02:50,069 --> 00:02:52,338
Do I really have to say it?

53
00:02:52,338 --> 00:02:54,440
You can tell by what I do

54
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,309
It would mean more if you said it

55
00:02:57,644 --> 00:02:59,646
Okay, I'll think about it

56
00:02:59,946 --> 00:03:01,614
Come here

57
00:03:11,391 --> 00:03:14,093
How long are you going to act like a kid?

58
00:03:14,427 --> 00:03:15,929
“I like you,” “I love you”

59
00:03:15,929 --> 00:03:18,131
Is it really that hard to say it out loud?

60
00:03:18,131 --> 00:03:19,332
I've told you over and over

61
00:03:19,332 --> 00:03:21,334
I don't feel loved by you

62
00:03:21,334 --> 00:03:22,569
I am trying too

63
00:03:22,569 --> 00:03:24,437
Why won't you acknowledge that?

64
00:03:24,437 --> 00:03:25,805
When have you tried?

65
00:03:25,805 --> 00:03:28,174
Have you even once lately told me

66
00:03:28,174 --> 00:03:30,076
That I'm pretty, that you love me?

67
00:03:30,076 --> 00:03:31,477
Only when we have sex

68
00:03:31,477 --> 00:03:34,147
You never say things like that otherwise

69
00:03:35,582 --> 00:03:37,083
I'm so sick of this

70
00:03:37,283 --> 00:03:38,551
What?

71
00:03:38,551 --> 00:03:39,953
Let's stop here

72
00:03:49,329 --> 00:03:51,331
I promised myself I'd date someone

73
00:03:51,331 --> 00:03:53,333
Who's good at showing love..

74
00:03:53,566 --> 00:03:55,001
Jihoon?

75
00:03:55,001 --> 00:03:55,702
Yeah?

76
00:03:55,702 --> 00:03:57,770
What are you thinking about?

77
00:03:58,304 --> 00:03:59,572
Oh, nothing

78
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:01,874
If you're done, should we head out?

79
00:04:16,022 --> 00:04:17,323
I had a good time today

80
00:04:17,323 --> 00:04:19,759
Could we… see each other again?

81
00:04:22,962 --> 00:04:24,764
Jihoon?

82
00:04:27,166 --> 00:04:27,967
I'm sorry

83
00:04:27,967 --> 00:04:31,237
I don't think I'm ready to see someone yet

84
00:04:34,907 --> 00:04:36,843
Even when I met someone decent

85
00:04:36,843 --> 00:04:37,844
My heart was still

86
00:04:37,844 --> 00:04:41,614
Stuck in the shadow of my ex

87
00:05:00,066 --> 00:05:02,068
[D: Jihoon]

88
00:05:28,995 --> 00:05:34,434
[Do you want to give us another try?]

89
00:05:34,434 --> 00:05:36,769
(Message unsent)

90
00:05:41,074 --> 00:05:43,042
Lee Dojin, what are you even doing

91
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:50,600
"The Long Relationship"
